flow-like-browser is the Chrome DevTools Protocol engine of Flow-Like. Parts
of it are derived from the third-party projects listed below. Each derived
source file starts with a one-line header naming its upstream source; the two
JSON templates in src/templates carry none (JSON has no comment syntax).

Original portions remain under their upstream licences (see the LICENSE-* and NOTICE-* files); modifications by Rheosoph GmbH are under the Flow-Like licence (../../LICENSE).

No Chromium, Chrome for Testing or other browser binary is distributed with
this crate.


